  "text": "Find Top Vet Specialists in Melbourne\nSkip to content\n03 9050 0671\nMon-Fri: 8am to 6pm\nSat-Sun: Emergency specialist referral surgery only\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nMeet our team\nLeading Experts in Small Animal Surgery, Internal Medicine, and Cancer Care.\nSurgeons\nExperienced surgeons are an integral part of our vet referral hospital’s multidisciplinary team, providing advanced\nsurgery and surgical procedures\nto achieve the best health outcomes for your pets.\nDr Adrian Wallace\nRegistered Specialist in Small Animal Surgery\nBVSc (Hons) MANZCVS Diplomate ECVS\nRead more\nDr Ricky Cashmore\nRegistered Specialist in Small Animal Surgery\nBVSc FANZCVS (SAS)\nRead more\nDr Alex Santamaria\nRegistered Specialist in Small Animal Surgery\nBSc, BVSc, MANZCVS (SAS), Diplomate of the American College of Veterinary Surgeons\nRead more\nDr Euan McLean​\nRegistered Specialist in Small Animal Surgery\nBSc, DVM, Dip-ECVS\nRead more\nDr Kath Duncan\nRegistered Specialist in Small Animal Surgery​\nBSc, DVM, MANZCVS (Surgery), Diplomate ECVS\nRead more\nDr Alastair Mather\nSpecialist in Small Animal Surgery\nBVSc, MSc, MRCVS, Diplomate ECVS\nRead more\nDr Sasha Polak\nSurgical Registrar\nBVSc, MVS, MANZCVS (Small Animal Surgery)\nRead more\nInternal Medicine\nOur experienced team specialising in veterinary\ninternal medicine\noffers advanced diagnostic and treatment options for pets facing complex health issues.\nDr Abigail Brough\nSpecialist in Small Animal Internal Medicine\nDVM\nRead more\nDr Kathryn Hogan\nRegistrar in Small Animal Internal Medicine\nBVSc, MVS (Murdoch), MVS (UofM), MANZCVS (Small Animal Medicine), ACVIM residency trained\nRead more\nOncology\nOur Melbourne vet hospital is dedicated to providing advanced\ncancer diagnostics and treatment\nfor pets. From early detection through techniques such as advanced imaging and biopsies to comprehensive treatment options, including surgery, immunotherapy, chemotherapy, and electrochemotherapy, we are here to support your pet at every stage.\nOncology Veterinarians\nCancer Diagnostics & Treatment\nOur MARS Oncology Veterinarians work together with our Internal Medicine and Surgical specialists to provide a broad scope of oncology support and treatments, helping ensure your pet receives the highest standard of cancer care.\nMeet the Specialists\nRefer Online Today\nOur wonderful team are ready to provide the best care\nMake a referral\nWe are dedicated to achieving the best possible outcomes for every pet and pet owner.\nWe accept\nVetPay\nand\nAfterpay.\nVisit our sister hospital for more specialist support at Geelong Animal Referral Services\nContact us\n03 9050 0671\nenquiries@marsvets.com.au\n619 Whitehorse Road, Mitcham VIC 3132\nMon-Fri: 8am to 6pm\nSat-Sun: Emergency specialist referral surgery only\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedin\n© 2025 Melbourne Animal Referral Services  |\nPrivacy\nABN: 76 652 987 310\nMARS IS MOVING!\nFrom\nMonday,\n31\nst\nAugust\n,\nwe will be located at our NEW address:\n619 Whitehorse Road,\nMitcham VIC 3132.\nPlease contact our team if you have any questions.\nGet in touch\nGet directions\nWE’VE MOVED — FIND US AT 619 WHITEHORSE ROAD, MITCHAM VIC 3132.\nGet directions",
